{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-07/1061138/block/singleImage/3253228/wm/01KY7JJGHMVCY7DFTK1FQXQ7QT.jpg?updatedAt=1793326923\"/><figcaption>警方接獲銅鑼灣告士打道281號渣打銀行職員報案，指一名女子企圖使用一張懷疑假100元美鈔存款。案件交由灣仔警區刑事調查隊第八隊跟進(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>周四（29日）下午5時35分，警方接獲銅鑼灣告士打道281號渣打銀行職員報案，指一名女子企圖使用一張懷疑假100元美鈔存款。 警員到場調查，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕該名36歲姓張持雙程證內地女子，她現正被扣留調查，案件交由灣仔警區刑事調查隊第八隊跟進。據了解，鈔票背面有「Fake」（偽造）的字樣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.139613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:22:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.110918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:21.667979+00:00","content_hash":"7920db20dcf22fb35e0ada8b0e70af1e2ba20c92da37c1652a2af363da8db351","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.139613+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}